  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a wok or large frying pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add shrimp, garlic, fresh peppercorns, soy sauce, and tomato sauce. Stir-fry for about 5 minutes until shrimp turn pink.",
    "While stir-frying, add rice khao kuha to the pan and cook on low-medium heat for about 10-12 minutes, ensuring it's evenly cooked and tender but not mushy.",
